  Unknown key "notesTemplate" at the top level; remove it or rename/move it to a supported location, or it is ignored.
  hint: "notesTemplate" is valid under "render:" — move it there so the compiler reads it; until then, it is ignored here.
ERROR CL0201 compile.cl.yaml
  Unknown key "placeholder" at the top level; remove it or rename/move it to a supported location, or it is ignored.
  hint: "placeholder" is not recognized, so it is ignored; rename it to "placeholders"."
`;

